				<wikidot:authorName>Elogee FishTruck</wikidot:authorName>				<wikidot:authorUserId>4037075</wikidot:authorUserId>				<content:encoded>
					<![CDATA[
						 <p>The image that was used in this article has been replaced with the following image, which is cc-compliant with the SCP wiki's license (CC BY-SA 3.0):</p> <blockquote> <p><strong>Source:</strong> <a href="https://www.flickr.com/photos/slgc/20875476745">Flickr</a><br /> <strong>License:</strong> CC BY 2.0<br /> <strong>Title:</strong> Phillies Phanatic Dancing With Usher On Country Music Night<br /> <strong>Author:</strong> slgckgc<br /> <strong>Release year:</strong> 2015</p> </blockquote> 
				 	]]>
